    {
      "Text": "This update for tesseract-ocr fixes the following issues:\n\nChanges in tesseract-ocr:\n\n- Update tesseract-CVE-2026-88053.patch to null the adaptive\n  template pointer arrays again and the class pruners as\n  upstream does, fixing an abort at exit on every run and\n  invalid frees when a corrupt traineddata is rejected\n  (boo#1282863)\n",
